  "usageGuide": "guides/components/group.md",
  "usage": {
    "summary": "`good-group` collects related content without the visual weight of a Card. It owns padding and spacing between projected children. `appearance=\"outline\"` (default) draws a quiet border and places an optional title in that border; `contrast` uses a soft theme-aware background; `plain` keeps the spacing with no surface. Set `title` to label the native `section`. `headingLevel` defaults to 2 and accepts 2, 3, or 4 so heading order remains correct. `headingId` can be set when a page needs a stable external reference. The title is omitted completely when empty.",
